,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_GARAGE"],"付費室內停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ3YcHCKoBKAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ3IcHCKkBKBI",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_KID_FRIENDLINESS_TIPS"],"親子友善程度",null,null,"分享親子友善程度相關資訊","親子友善程度",null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ3IcHCKsBKBM",null,null,["有兒童椅"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ3YcHCK0BKAA"],[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ3YcHCK4BKAE"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ3IcHCKwBKBQ",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["Mo-Mo Paradise 壽喜燒是我一直以來蠻常回訪的品牌，整體印象其實不錯。肉質穩定、菜類選擇也豐富，基本水準都有維持。\n\n不過這次用餐體驗有幾個小地方比較可惜：\n\n當天入座後點餐才發現「豬五花缺貨」，這點如果能在入座前先提醒，會更好安排點餐選擇，體驗上會更順，因爲只吃豬肉的朋友變成只有單項選擇\n\n另外在結帳時櫃檯有出現排隊狀況，現場動線與人員應對稍微有點卡，整體流暢度可以再加強。\n\n因為我平常也常去Mo-Mo Paradise 大江店，那邊整體流程與服務都蠻順暢的，這次的落差就稍微有感。\n\n整體來說還是會回訪，但如果上述細節能再優化，體驗會更完整。",null,[0,84]]]],[null,1777902393000000,1777902393000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfb3RlaVdlUkxJNk1ieU9TcEtuLXBkdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfb3RlaVdlUkxJNk1ieU9TcEtuLXBkdxoTQ2d3SXVjYml6d1lRaV82bXhRSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiS0PPkzNKWAxUngq8BHbqnLEkQ_2MIrwEoFQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15044688044154004129/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVlV4WGJETlZSRkl5WkVSU1QxZEVTbGxTUnpGRlZWTXhhMDVIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15044688044154004129/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVlV4WGJETlZSRkl5WkVSU1QxZEVTbGxTUnpGRlZWTXhhMDVIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15044688044154004129/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaT